---
/** Only rendered in an explicitly enabled production build. No analytics without a choice. */
---
<section aria-label="Privacy and analytics" data-ga4-consent data-ga4-enabled="true">
  <details>
    <summary>Privacy and analytics preferences</summary>
    <p>
      Optional Google Analytics helps us understand visits to these public resource pages.
      It loads only if you choose Allow analytics. Google receives cookie identifiers,
      page and device information, and your network address when your browser connects to it.
      Google processes these under its
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      This is not anonymous browsing.
    </p>
    <p>
      We send approved page addresses without query strings, limited campaign labels, and
      approved referrer domains. We do not send names, contact details, financial information,
      or form contents. Advertising consent stays denied. Your preference is stored in this
      browser for up to 180 days. Analytics cookies expire after up to 180 days.
      You can withdraw consent here. Browser Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control turn
      optional analytics off. Clearing browser storage resets your preference.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our hosting provider Cloudflare processes requests to deliver and secure this site.
      Hosting request totals can include automated traffic. Optional Google Analytics
      measures consented browser visits and will report lower totals.
    </p>
    <div class="analytics-actions">
      <button type="button" data-analytics-choice="allow">Allow analytics</button>
      <button type="button" data-analytics-choice="deny">Decline analytics</button>
      <button type="button" data-analytics-choice="internal">Exclude my internal tests</button>
    </div>
    <p id="analytics-status" role="status">Optional analytics off until you choose.</p>
    <noscript>Optional analytics is off because JavaScript is disabled.</noscript>
  </details>
</section>
<script is:inline type="module" src="/analytics.js"></script>
<style>
  section { margin-block: 1rem; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; padding-block: .75rem; }
  .analytics-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; }
  button { font: inherit; padding: .75rem 1rem; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; background: #fff; color: #172b36; border: 2px solid #172b36; border-radius: .25rem; }
  button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #007aa3; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
